<title>USA: Mac Frugal's Q1 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Mac Frugal's Q1 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>DOMINGUEZ, Calif. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amounts In Thousands Except Per Share Amounts</p>
<p>					   For the three months ended</p>
<p>					May 4,			Apr 28,</p>
<p>					   1997			  1996</p>
<p> NET SALES			 $183,464		    $159,132</p>
<p> COST OF SALES		    104,910			88,726</p>
<p> GROSS PROFIT			78,554			70,406</p>
<p> Store expenses		    50,863			47,691</p>
<p>Warehouse and administrative</p>
<p>   expenses			  17,832			15,329</p>
<p> TOTAL OPERATING EXPENSES	68,695			63,020</p>
