<p> NET EARNINGS			 5,990			 3,512</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER COMMON SHARE	 0.24			  0.14</p>
<p> AVERAGE SHARES OUTSTANDING    25,414			25,694</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Mac Frugal's Bargains-Closeouts Inc</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
